# Cloudflare Pages headers — required for a static client-side app that runs
# IndexedDB, WebCrypto and the EmulatorJS WebAssembly core.
#
# The COOP/COEP pair below is intentionally NOT enabled by default: EmulatorJS
# loads its core from https://cdn.emulatorjs.org and COEP=require-corp would
# block that cross-origin script/wasm and produce a blank player. Only add them
# if you self-host the core and need SharedArrayBuffer (threaded cores).

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: gamepad=*, fullscreen=*, autoplay=*, interest-cohort=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups
